i0(input, *, out=None) -> Tensor

Computes the zeroth order modified Bessel function of the first kind for each element of :attr:`input`.

.. math::
    \text{out}_{i} = I_0(\text{input}_{i}) = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(\text{input}_{i}^2/4)^k}{(k!)^2}


Args:
